From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Verzol <giangtuanminh2703@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:25:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add EarlyMule-TG configs for 10K and 80K simulations

- conf_10K.json: 10K run with the keys missing from paramFiles/10K/conf.json.
- 10K-earlymule: cycle alerts use schedule_id=1 (RANDOM_INTERVAL, sorted)
  so relays receive before they send.
- 80K-earlymule-a100/a200: 10K-earlymule accounts and normal models x8,
  with 100 or 200 alerts (fan_in/fan_out/cycle = 30/30/40).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
